%description:
Tests a lost probe of the path MTU search (mtuProbing = 2). The scenario is that
of tcp_mtu_probe_1, but the path drops each packet larger than 1100 bytes
without an ICMP error (the pathMtu of the tester). The probe of MTU 1026 gets
through and raises the MSS to 986; the probe of 1223 bytes (MTU 1263) is
dropped (B040). The third duplicate ACK, with the probe as the first
unacknowledged segment, shows that only the probe is lost (RFC 4821 section
7.6.2, Linux tcp_fastretrans_alert()): the search continues below it (1026 to
1262), and the probe goes again as segments of the MSS (B056, B057), without a
congestion response (tcp_simple_retransmit()). The window stays, so the search
goes on: the probe of MTU 1144 is dropped too (1026 to 1143). The MSS stays
986. The algorithm is TcpNewReno with SACK (RFC 6675).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.0 60000"
*.srv_tcp.mss = 600
*.cli_tcp.mss = 1460
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.mtuProbing = 2
*.srv_tcp.baseMss = 512
*.srv_tcp.pathMtu = 1500
*.tcptester.pathMtu = 1100

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.021 B040] A.1000 < B.2000: A 23687:24910(1223) ack 1 win 16384 # dropping, larger than the path MTU
[1.021 B041] A.1000 < B.2000: A 24910:25896(986) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1026 is acknowledged, snd_mss is 986
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1263 is lost, the search runs from 1026 to 1262
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the lost MTU probe goes again as segments of the MSS, without a congestion response
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.025 B056] A.1000 < B.2000: A 23687:24673(986) ack 1 win 16384 
[1.025 B057] A.1000 < B.2000: A 24673:24910(237) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1144 is lost, the search runs from 1026 to 1143
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
snd_mss is 1223
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
